render('courses-page.html','Abacus, Vedic Maths & Rubik’s Cube Programs', 'Explore abacus, Vedic Maths and Rubik’s Cube programs at The Numbers Academy in Hyderabad. Ask about learning levels, online classes and batch availability.',head('Find their next “aha!” moment.','Three programs. Plenty of ways to explore. Choose a new challenge that suits your child’s interests and learning goals.','OUR PROGRAMS')+f'<section class="wrap bottom-space">{cards()}</section>'+modes()+cta())

